{"skill":"yasuo_p","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoPassive_Name","text":"浪客之道"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoPassive_Summary","text":"亚索的暴击几率提升。此外，亚索在移动时会为一层护盾攒能。护盾会在他受到来自英雄或野怪的伤害时触发。"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoPassive_Tooltip","text":"<spellPassive>百折不屈：</spellPassive>亚索在移动的同时会积攒<keywordMajor>剑意</keywordMajor>——移动得越快，<keywordMajor>剑意</keywordMajor>的获取就越多。当<keywordMajor>剑意</keywordMajor>槽被充满时，在受到来自英雄或野怪的伤害的同时，亚索暂时获得<shield>@ShieldValue@护盾值</shield>。<br><br><spellPassive>向死而生：</spellPassive>亚索的暴击几率提升@CritChanceMultiplier*100@%但他的暴击伤害降低至@CurrentCritDamage@。100%以上的暴击几率，会每1%转化为<physicalDamage>@YasuoCritToAD*.01@额外攻击力</physicalDamage>。"},"keyTooltipExtended":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoPassive_TooltipExtended","text":"{{Spell_YasuoPassive_Tooltip}}<br><br><rules>【向死而生】会在其它暴击几率修正效果之后进行计算。<br><onlyShowInGame>当前加成：@f2@%暴击几率，<physicalDamage>@f3@额外攻击力</physicalDamage>。</onlyShowInGame></rules>"}},"spellCastTime":0.25,"values":[{"name":"YasuoCritToAD","values":[50,50,50,50,50,50,50],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"CritChanceMultiplier","values":[1,1,1,1,1,1,1],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"CritDamageMod","values":[0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071],"__type":"SpellDataValue"}],"calculations":{"ShieldValue":{"mFormulaParts":[{"mStartValue":125,"mEndValue":600,"mScaleByStatProgressionMultiplier":true,"__type":"ByCharLevelInterpolationCalculationPart"}],"__type":"GameCalculation"},"{74ce5438}":{"mFormulaParts":[{"mLevel1Value":55,"mBreakpoints":[{"mLevel":7,"mAdditionalBonusAtThisLevel":-5,"__type":"Breakpoint"},{"mLevel":13,"mAdditionalBonusAtThisLevel":-5,"__type":"Breakpoint"},{"mLevel":19,"mAdditionalBonusAtThisLevel":-5,"__type":"Breakpoint"},{"mLevel":25,"mAdditionalBonusAtThisLevel":-5,"__type":"Breakpoint"}],"__type":"ByCharLevelBreakpointsCalculationPart"}],"__type":"GameCalculation"},"CurrentCritDamage":{"mExpandedTooltipCalculationDisplay":6,"mFormulaParts":[{"mStat":9,"mCoefficient":1,"__type":"StatByCoefficientCalculationPart"}],"mDisplayAsPercent":true,"__type":"GameCalculation"}},"other":{}}
{"skill":"yasuo_q","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoQ1Wrapper_Name","text":"斩钢闪"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoQ1Wrapper_Summary","text":"向前出剑，呈直线造成伤害。<br><br>在命中时，斩钢闪会获得一层旋风烈斩效果，持续数秒。在积攒2层旋风烈斩效果后，斩钢闪会形成一阵能够<font color='#6655CC'>击飞</font>敌人的旋风。<br><br>斩钢闪被视为普通攻击，并且可以从所有作用于普攻的东西上获得收益。"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoQ1Wrapper_Tooltip","text":"亚索进行戳刺，造成<physicalDamage>@TotalDamage@物理伤害</physicalDamage>。如果他命中了，那么他会获得一层持续@GatheringStormDuration@秒的层数。当他拥有2层时，这个技能的下次施放将会发射出一道远程龙卷风，造成等值伤害和@KnockUpDurationTOOLTIPONLY@秒<status>击飞</status>。<br><br>如果在冲刺期间施放，那么这个技能会呈环状进行打击而非直接戳刺。"},"keyCost":{"sourceKey":"Spell_Cost_NoCost","text":"无消耗"},"keyCooldown":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoQ1Wrapper_Cooldown","text":"@f1@秒%i:cooldown%"},"keyTooltipExtendedBelowLine":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoQ1Wrapper_TooltipExtendedBelowLine","text":"<rules>这个技能和攻击类似：它可以暴击以造成<physicalDamage>@TotalDamageCrit@物理伤害</physicalDamage>，它会对击中的首个敌人施加%i:OnHit% <OnHit>攻击特效</OnHit>，可被控制效果打断，并且它的冷却时间和施放时间可通过<attackSpeed>攻击速度</attackSpeed>来缩短。</rules>"}},"spellCastTime":0.125,"values":[{"name":"BaseDamage","values":[-5,20,45,70,95,120,145],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"StabRange","values":[450,450,450,450,450,450,450],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"TornadoRange","values":[1100,1100,1100,1100,1100,1100,1100],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"Cooldown","values":[4,4,4,4,4,4,4],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"StabWidth","values":[80,80,80,80,80,80,80],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"SpinWidth","values":[260,260,260,260,260,260,260],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"GatheringStormDuration","values":[6,6,6,6,6,6,6],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"KnockUpDurationTOOLTIPONLY","values":[1,1,1,1,1,1,1],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"ADRatio","values":[1.0499999523162842,1.0499999523162842,1.0499999523162842,1.0499999523162842,1.0499999523162842,1.0499999523162842,1.0499999523162842],"__type":"SpellDataValue"}],"calculations":{"TotalDamage":{"mFormulaParts":[{"mDataValue":