{"skill":"yasuo_w","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoW_Name","text":"风之障壁"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoW_Summary","text":"形成一个持续4秒的气流之墙，来阻挡敌方的飞行道具。"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoW_Tooltip","text":"亚索形成一个持续4秒的气流浮墙，来阻挡敌方的飞行道具。"},"keyCost":{"sourceKey":"Spell_Cost_NoCost","text":"无消耗"},"keyTooltipExtendedBelowLine":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoW_TooltipExtendedBelowLine","text":"<rules>无法阻挡防御塔的子弹与光束。</rules>"}},"spellCastTime":0,"mCastTime":0.013000000268220901,"values":[{"name":"WallLife","values":[4,4,4,4,4,4,4],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"Width","values":[250,320,390,460,530,600,670],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"TravelRange","values":[450,450,450,450,450,450,450],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"BubbleRadius","values":[300,300,300,300,300,300,300],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"Thickness","values":[100,100,100,100,100,100,100],"__type":"SpellDataValue"}],"other":{"cooldownTime":[27,25,23,21,19,17,15],"Cooldown":{"values":[27,25,23,21,19,17,15],"{0a3e0478}":27,"__type":"{0a0eddc9}"}}}
{"skill":"yasuo_e","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoE_Name","text":"踏前斩"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoE_Summary","text":"向目标敌人突进，造成魔法伤害。每次施法都会提升你的后续突进的伤害，直到抵达上限。<br><br>在若干秒内无法对相同敌人重复施放。<br><br><font color='#99FF99'>如果在突进的过程中施放斩钢闪，那么斩钢闪就会呈环状出剑。</font>"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoE_Tooltip","text":"亚索冲刺并穿过一个目标，造成<magicDamage>@TotalDamage@魔法伤害</magicDamage>。这个技能每次施放后都会为@StackDuration@秒内的后续施放提供<magicDamage>@BonusDamagePerStack@</magicDamage>额外伤害，至多可叠加@MaxStacks@次。<br><br>这个技能对每个目标有@PerTargetCooldown@秒冷却时间。"},"keyCost":{"sourceKey":"Spell_Cost_NoCost","text":"无消耗"}},"spellCastTime":0.25,"values":[{"name":"MaxStacks","values":[4,4,4,4,4,4,4],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"StackDuration","values":[5,5,5,5,5,5,5],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"BaseDamage","values":[55,70,85,100,115,130,145],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"APRatio","values":[0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"ADRatio","values":[0.20000000298023224,0.20000000298023224,0.20000000298023224,0.20000000298023224,0.20000000298023224,0.20000000298023224,0.20000000298023224],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"PerTargetCooldown","values":[11,10,9,8,7,6,6],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"BaseDashSpeed","values":[750,750,750,750,750,750,750],"__type":"SpellDataValue"}],"calculations":{"TotalDamage":{"mFormulaParts":[{"mDataValue":"BaseDamage","__type":"NamedDataValueCalculationPart"},{"mStat":2,"mStatFormula":2,"mDataValue":"ADRatio","__type":"StatByNamedDataValueCalculationPart"},{"mDataValue":"APRatio","__type":"StatByNamedDataValueCalculationPart"}],"__type":"GameCalculation"},"BonusDamagePerStack":{"mMultiplier":{"mNumber":0.25,"__type":"NumberCalculationPart"},"mModifiedGameCalculation":"TotalDamage","__type":"GameCalculationModified"}},"other":{"cooldownTime":[0.5,0.5,0.4000000059604645,0.30000001192092896,0.20000000298023224,0.10000000149011612,0.10000000149011612],"Cooldown":{"values":[0.5,0.5,0.4000000059604645,0.30000001192092896,0.20000000298023224,0.10000000149011612,0.10000000149011612],"__type":"{0a0eddc9}"},"mDoesNotConsumeCooldown":true,"mSpellCooldownOrSealedQueueThreshold":0.5}}
{"skill":"yasuo_r","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoR_Name","text":"狂风绝息斩"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoR_Summary","text":"闪烁到一个<factionIonia1>浮空</factionIonia1>的敌方英雄身边，造成物理伤害，并使范围内的所有<factionIonia1>浮空</factionIonia1>的敌人滞留在空中。获得满额的剑意值，但会重置旋风烈斩的层数。<br><br>在接下来的若干秒里，亚索的暴击会获得显著的额外护甲穿透加成值。"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YasuoR_Tooltip","text":"亚索传送到一名<status>浮空</status>的敌方英雄身边，造成<physicalDamage>@Damage@物理伤害</physicalDamage>并使所有附近<status>浮空</status>的敌人们维持此状态至多@RKnockupDuration@秒。亚索还会获得满额<keywordMajor>剑意</keywordMajor>，但会失去所有所有<spellName>{{Spell_YasuoQ1Wrapper_Name}}</spellName>层数。<br><br>之后，亚索的暴击会无视<scaleArmor>@RPercentArmorPen@%额外护甲</scaleArmor>，持续@RBuffDuration@秒。"},"keyCost":{"sourceKey":"Spell_Cost_NoCost","text":"无消耗"}},"spellCastTime":0.25,"values":[{"name":"RBaseDamage","values":[50,200,350,500,650,800,950],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"RPercentArmorPen","values":[60,60,60,60,60,60,60],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"RBuffDuration","values":[15,15,15,15,15,15,15],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"RKnockupDuration","values":[1,1,1,1,1,1,1],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"RRadius","values":[400,400,400,400,400,400,400],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"RCastSearchRadius","values":[1100,1100,1100,1100,1100,1100,1100],"__type":"SpellDataValue"}],"calculations":{"Damage":{"mFormulaParts":[{"mDataValue":"RBaseDamage","__type":"NamedDataValueCalculationPart"},{"mStat":2,"mStatFormula":2,"mCoefficient":1.5,"__type":"StatByCoefficientCalculationPart"}],"__type":"GameCalculation"}},"other":{"cooldownTime":[105,70,50,30,30,30,30],"Cooldown":{"values":[105,70,50,30,30,30,30],"__type":"{0a0eddc9}"}}}
{"skill":"yone_p","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YonePassive_Name","text":"狩人之道"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YonePassive_Tooltip","text":"<spellPassive>凡灵双剑：</spellPassive>永恩手持双剑，所以他的每第二次攻击可造成<magicDamage>@MagicDamageSplit*100@%魔法伤害</magicDamage>。<br><br><spellPassive>向死而生：</spellPassive>永恩的暴击几率提升@CritChanceMultiplier*100@%，但暴击伤害降低至@CurrentCritDamage@。100%以上的暴击几率，会每1%转化为<physicalDamage>@YoneCritToAD*.01@额外攻击力</physicalDamage>。"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YonePassive_Summary","text":"永恩每第二次攻击造成魔法伤害。此外，他的暴击几率提升。"},"keyTooltipExtended":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YonePassive_TooltipExtended","text":"{{Spell_YonePassive_Tooltip}}<br><br><rules>【向死而生】会在其它暴击几率修正效果之后计算。<br><onlyShowInGame>当前加成：@f2@%暴击几率，<physicalDamage>@f3@额外攻击力</physicalDamage>。</onlyShowInGame></rules>"}},"spellCastTime":0.25,"values":[{"name":"MagicDamageSplit","values":[0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"YoneCritToAD","values":[50,50,50,50,50,50,50],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"CritChanceMultiplier","values":[1,1,1,1,1,1,1],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"CritDamageMod","values":[0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071,0.949999988079071],"__type":"SpellDataValue"}],"calculations":{"CurrentCritDamage":{"mExpandedTooltipCalculationDisplay":6,"mFormulaParts":[{"mStat":9,"mCoefficient":1,"__type":"StatByCoefficientCalculationPart"}],"mDisplayAsPercent":true,"__type":"GameCalculation"}},"other":{"cooldownTime":[0,0,0,0,0,0,0],"Cooldown":{"values":[0,0,0,0,0,0,0],"{0a3e0478}":0,"__type":"{0a0eddc9}"}}}
{"skill":"yone_q","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YoneQ_Name","text":"错玉切"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YoneQ_Summary","text":"向前出剑，呈直线造成伤害。<br><br>在命中时，错玉切会获得一层旋风烈斩效果，持续数秒。在2层时，错玉切会使永恩向前冲刺并带着一阵能够<status>击飞</status>敌人的旋风。"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YoneQ_Tooltip","text":"永恩向前出剑，造成<physicalDamage>@QDamage@物理伤害</physicalDamage>。<br><br>在命中时，提供一层持续@BuffDuration@秒的可叠加效果。在积攒2层效果后，这个技能会使永恩向前冲刺，并带着一阵能够<status>击飞</status>敌人@Q3KnockupDuration@秒的的旋风，造成<physicalDamage>@QDamage@物理伤害</physicalDamage>。 "},"keyCost":{"sourceKey":"Spell_Cost_NoCost","text":"无消耗"},"keyCooldown":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YoneQ_Cooldown","text":"@f1@秒冷却时间"},"keyTooltipExtendedBelowLine":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YoneQ_TooltipExtendedBelowLine","text":"<rules>这个技能和攻击类似：它可以暴击以造成<physicalDamage>@TotalDamageCrit@物理伤害</physicalDamage>，它会对击中的首个敌人施加%i:OnHit% <OnHit>攻击特效</OnHit>，可被控制效果打断，并且它的冷却时间和施放时间可通过<attackSpeed>攻击速度</attackSpeed>来缩短。</rules>"}},"spellCastTime":0.3499999940395355,"mCastTime":0.3499999940395355,"values":[{"name":"BaseDamage","values":[0,25,50,75,100,125,150],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"ADRatio","values":[1.100000023841858,1.100000023841858,1.100000023841858,1.100000023841858,1.100000023841858,1.100000023841858,1.100000023841858],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"Width","values":[80,80,80,80,80,80,80],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"BuffDuration","values":[6,6,6,6,6,6,6],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"Q3MaxDistance","values":[450,450,450,450,450,450,450],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"Q3MinDistance","values":[450,450,450,450,450,450,450],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"Q3DashSpeed","values":[1500,1500,1500,1500,1500,1500,1500],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"Q3AoESize","values":[100,100,100,100,100,100,100],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"QAttackSpeedCDPercent","values":[0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579,0.6000000238418579],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"QAttackSpe