{"skill":"yone_e","text":{"keyName":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YoneE_Name","text":"破障之锋"},"keySummary":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YoneE_Summary","text":"永恩的灵体离开他的身体，并获得移动速度。当这个技能结束时，永恩的灵体会被强制返回他的身体，并且他会再次造成伤害，伤害值相当于一部分他在灵体形态中造成的伤害。"},"keyTooltip":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YoneE_Tooltip","text":"永恩进入灵体形态@ReturnTimer@秒，期间会将他的身体留在原地，并获得<speed>不断提升的@StartingMS*100@%</speed>到<speed>@MovementSpeed*100@%移动速度</speed>。<br><br>当灵体形态结束时，永恩会返回他的身体，并再次造成伤害，伤害值相当于他在此期间对英雄造成伤害的@DeathmarkPercent*100@%。你可以在灵体形态期间<recast>再次</recast>施放这个技能。<br><br><recast>再次施放：</recast>提前结束灵体形态。"},"keyCost":{"sourceKey":"Spell_Cost_NoCost","text":"无消耗"},"keyTooltipExtendedBelowLine":{"sourceKey":"Spell_YoneE_TooltipExtendedBelowLine","text":"<rules>永恩在受到硬控效果期间无法返回。</rules>"}},"values":[{"name":"ReturnTimer","values":[5,5,5,5,5,5,5],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"MovementSpeed","values":[0.30000001192092896,0.30000001192092896,0.30000001192092896,0.30000001192092896,0.30000001192092896,0.30000001192092896,0.30000001192092896],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"DeathmarkBase","values":[5,20,35,50,65,80,95],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"DeathmarkPercent","values":[0.22499999403953552,0.25,0.2750000059604645,0.30000001192092896,0.32499998807907104,0.3499999940395355,0.375],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"RecastLockout","values":[0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"EDashRange","values":[300,300,300,300,300,300,300],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"EDashSpeed","values":[1200,1200,1200,1200,1200,1200,1200],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"OnHitIncrease","values":[0.25,0.25,0.25,0.25,0.25,0.25,0.25],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"StartingMS","values":[0.10000000149011612,0.10000000149011612,0.10000000149011612,0.10000000149011612,0.10000000149011612,0.10000000149011612,0.10000000149011612],"__type":"SpellDataValue"},{"name":"MissingHealthPercent","values":[0.22499999403953552,0.25,0.2750000059604645,0.30000001192092896,0.32499998807907104,0.3499999940395355,0.375],"__type":